Add a mobile debug logging contribution (VS Server Android).

When code-server is launched with scripts/termux-start.sh debug (CS_DEBUG_LOG_DIR
set), the server exposes /-/android-debug/{ping,log} and this contribution
streams browser-side diagnostics to <Descargas>/log/client.log: console errors,
window errors, unhandled rejections, keyboard/input/composition traces (what the
soft keyboard really sends), virtual-keyboard viewport changes and focus moves.
Does nothing when the endpoint is absent.

